  "details": "I assume this may be a race condition. When making a pickup easily accessible via having it follow the back of the player head (useful for game worlds), the player will not be able to pickup the pickup and instead grab their physbones on their avatar. This is always the case when self-interactions are on. When self-interactions or toggled off (via the menu), being able the pick up the pickup is inconsistent. Test world to see issue https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0ee7384b-e298-4a2f-988e-362585301f28",
